---
// Chapter 02: Germination & Unfolding
---
<section class="chapter-germination" aria-label="Chapter 02: Germination">
  <div class="content-card">
    <div class="chapter-eyebrow">
      <span class="chapter-num">02</span>
      <span class="chapter-sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span class="chapter-title">GERMINATION & UNFOLDING</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">
      Cultivating at the intersection of <em class="serif-accent">design</em>, <em class="serif-accent">code</em>, and living systems.
    </h2>

    <p class="section-desc">
      Digital spaces shouldn't feel like cold machinery. In this garden, every contour, shader, and interaction is cultivated with organic rhythm and intentional craft.
    </p>

    <div class="vitality-grid">
      <div class="vitality-card">
        <span class="vitality-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="vitality-info">
          <span class="vitality-label">ARCHITECTURE</span>
          <span class="vitality-val">ORGANIC GLSL + THREE.JS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vitality-card">
        <span class="vitality-dot dot-pollen" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="vitality-info">
          <span class="vitality-label">GROWTH STAGE</span>
          <span class="vitality-val">UNFOLDING PETALS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .chapter-germination {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content-card {
    max-width: 640px;
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(15, 36, 25, 0.05);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .chapter-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-leaf);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .chapter-num {
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.12);
    color: var(--color-leaf);
  }

  .chapter-sep {
    color: var(--color-border);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-forest);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .serif-accent {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-leaf);
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .vitality-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .vitality-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(20, 45, 30, 0.06);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .vitality-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-sage);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(82, 183, 136, 0.6);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .vitality-dot.dot-pollen {
    background: var(--color-pollen);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(229, 160, 46, 0.6);
  }

  .vitality-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .vitality-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
  }

  .vitality-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-forest);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .content-card {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
    .vitality-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
